Track 2: 0xDEAD-SIGNAL
- Story & Context: Mara sits in the silence of her living room, staring at the flicker of a cathode-ray tube as she confesses to the ghost in the machine that she was the one who jammed the transmission. She touches the cold glass screen with a trembling finger, watching as the corrupted waveforms mirror the shame she kept buried under layers of scrap metal. "I am the fault in your binary prayer."
