Track 3: The Archive-Rot
- Story & Context: The city now honors the Archive-Rot as a holy event where all local broadcasters simultaneously go silent to commemorate the day the magnetic gods reclaimed the signal from the living. In the center of the ruins, a monument of fused VCR players hums with the residual energy of the first tape, forever vibrating in the heat of a perpetual mid-afternoon sun. "Silence is the only data that survives the storm."
